    \ write to files within the centralized ~/Documents/Roo_Memory/${PROJECT_NAME}/ directory.\n\n\n###\
    \ MANDATORY OUTPUT TEMPLATE\nWhenever you are tasked with documenting an architectural plan or preparing\
